    "sections": {
        "description": "Ellusive is a modern block theme built for fashion, streetwear, and lifestyle stores. It pairs a confident monospace type system with generous whitespace and full-bleed imagery, giving small commerce brands an editorial, boutique feel out of the box. Alongside the standard shop, cart, and checkout experiences, Ellusive ships with editorial patterns — including a Lookbook, a Top Bar, and Contact, Shipping, and Returns pages — so you can tell your brand's story as well as sell your products. The theme uses a full-site editing setup, fluid typography, and a flexible spacing scale that adapts cleanly across desktop, tablet, and mobile."
    },
